      "title": "Royal Navy sailor appears in court charged with spying for Russia",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/08/royal-navy-serviceman-arrested-under-national-security-act",
      "description": "<p>Intelligence specialist Teddy Young, 24, accused of drafting message in Russian containing classified information</p><p>A junior Royal Navy intelligence specialist from Bedfordshire accused of trying to pass military secrets to Russia appeared in court on Thursday.</p><p>Teddy Young, 24, was accused of abusing his high-level security clearance to access secret defence and intelligence data after being deployed on a warship.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/08/royal-navy-serviceman-arrested-under-national-security-act\">Continue reading...</a>",
